WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.410
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.680 --> 01:47.940
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.039 --> 01:50.890
[Episode 18]

4
01:54.750 --> 01:55.580
[Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]

5
01:55.580 --> 01:58.200
[(Not sent) Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]

6
01:58.200 --> 02:01.130
[Please send a friend verification request first.]

7
02:17.680 --> 02:18.590
Hello?

8
02:24.620 --> 02:26.410
Let's go to the aquarium tomorrow.

9
02:26.410 --> 02:29.150
You want to go with me?

10
02:29.900 --> 02:30.340
Mm.

11
02:33.130 --> 02:33.579
Mm.

12
02:35.000 --> 02:36.060
Sleep early.

13
02:38.090 --> 02:38.960
You too.

14
02:40.420 --> 02:41.280
Uh, good night.

15
02:42.190 --> 02:42.850
Good night.

16
02:43.710 --> 02:44.150
Mm.

17
02:46.340 --> 02:47.090
Bye.

18
02:54.520 --> 02:55.560
Sore throat?

19
02:56.560 --> 02:58.220
No, it's just a bit cloying.

20
02:58.430 --> 03:00.090
I need some tea to wash it down.

21
03:06.170 --> 03:07.980
A text would've been enough.

22
03:08.010 --> 03:09.690
Why did you call?

23
03:09.690 --> 03:10.750
Seriously.

24
03:16.090 --> 03:17.820
Right, I deleted him on WeChat.

25
03:19.090 --> 03:20.710
I... I...

26
03:41.750 --> 03:43.360
What time tomorrow?

27
03:47.560 --> 03:48.220
You decide.

28
03:50.130 --> 03:51.079
I decide?

29
03:54.410 --> 03:56.740
Let's have breakfast together.

30
04:01.370 --> 04:01.810
Mm.

31
04:14.090 --> 04:15.690
He shouldn't have noticed.

32
04:17.100 --> 04:18.010
I guess so.

33
04:23.720 --> 04:24.450
Yun Li,

34
04:25.600 --> 04:26.750
we've been hanging out for a while.

35
04:26.750 --> 04:28.280
Aren't you going to join us?

36
04:29.190 --> 04:30.420
Oh. No, it's late.

37
04:30.420 --> 04:32.110
I'd like to sleep early.

38
04:32.650 --> 04:33.659
Such a healthy routine.

39
04:33.659 --> 04:34.500
I should learn from you.

40
04:34.500 --> 04:35.600
Then take these fruits

41
04:35.600 --> 04:36.290
for yourself.

42
04:36.290 --> 04:37.920
No thanks. I've brushed my teeth.

43
04:37.920 --> 04:38.310
I...

44
04:38.310 --> 04:40.070
Share it with everyone.

45
04:44.950 --> 04:47.159
Actually, I have something to tell you.

46
04:47.159 --> 04:48.120
What a coincidence.

47
04:48.120 --> 04:49.980
I have something to tell you, too.

48
04:51.620 --> 04:52.680
I think it's better

49
04:53.550 --> 04:54.900
for a guy to say it.

50
04:56.620 --> 04:57.860
I was rude this morning.

51
04:57.860 --> 04:58.800
I apologize.

52
04:59.010 --> 04:59.720
Maybe it's

53
04:59.720 --> 05:01.220
because I'm interested in you.

54
05:01.220 --> 05:02.860
So when Congsheng's uncle

55
05:03.060 --> 05:04.550
took a little extra care of you,

56
05:04.550 --> 05:05.600
I started overthinking...

57
05:05.600 --> 05:06.800
I-It's fine.

58
05:06.800 --> 05:08.010
What I want to say is...

59
05:08.010 --> 05:10.470
So there's nothing going on between you two,

60
05:10.540 --> 05:11.160
right?

61
05:11.560 --> 05:12.360
We...

62
05:14.620 --> 05:15.240
We...

63
05:20.270 --> 05:21.400
Wanna watch a movie?

64
05:24.500 --> 05:25.070
Join us.

65
05:41.240 --> 05:41.840
Handsome.

66
05:44.190 --> 05:45.990
Can you leave the fruit platter?

67
05:47.690 --> 05:48.500
For the movie.

68
05:50.770 --> 05:51.330
Thanks.

69
05:58.480 --> 05:59.140
Have a seat.

70
06:11.720 --> 06:13.890
Here, have some fruit.

71
06:16.300 --> 06:17.100
Thanks.

72
06:18.310 --> 06:19.600
It's free anyway.

73
06:23.500 --> 06:24.300
Um...

74
06:25.160 --> 06:26.310
I'll head out.

75
06:26.800 --> 06:28.130
N-No, you don't have to.

76
06:28.770 --> 06:29.330
You...

77
06:35.220 --> 06:35.740
Okay.

78
06:37.190 --> 06:38.320
What shall we watch?

79
06:39.890 --> 06:41.290
How about a documentary?

80
06:44.250 --> 06:44.890
Sure.

81
07:56.540 --> 07:57.670
It's getting late.

82
07:58.000 --> 07:59.930
Why don't we watch it another time?

83
08:02.690 --> 08:03.160
Sure.

84
08:03.160 --> 08:05.100
I-I... I'll head back then.

85
08:06.190 --> 08:07.860
I'll take this back.

86
08:14.100 --> 08:15.250
Um, I'm off.

87
08:15.250 --> 08:16.010
Good night.

88
08:16.370 --> 08:16.890
Bye.

89
08:16.890 --> 08:17.890
I'll walk her out.

90
08:22.440 --> 08:23.980
I'm heading back.

91
08:32.110 --> 08:33.890
Good night. Sweet dreams.

92
08:35.320 --> 08:35.980
Good night.

93
08:52.100 --> 08:52.860
You're back.

94
09:01.250 --> 09:02.410
So that plushie

95
09:03.410 --> 09:04.670
wasn't a token of love?

96
09:17.000 --> 09:17.790
You're back.

97
09:18.860 --> 09:20.500
I'm so sleepy.

98
09:21.600 --> 09:23.650
Then go wash up quickly.

99
09:29.150 --> 09:30.410
What's with that look?

100
09:31.550 --> 09:32.360
Lili,

101
09:32.790 --> 09:33.600
Fu Shize invited you

102
09:33.600 --> 09:34.720
to his room to watch a movie,

103
09:34.720 --> 09:35.450
and you went?

104
09:37.290 --> 09:38.860
B-But Mr. Xu was there too.

105
09:38.860 --> 09:40.150
We weren't alone.

106
09:41.750 --> 09:42.820
I knew

107
09:42.820 --> 09:43.460
Fu Shize

108
09:43.460 --> 09:44.860
wouldn't be such a creep.

109
09:46.410 --> 09:47.220
Tangy,

110
09:47.720 --> 09:49.120
I need to talk to you.

111
09:52.050 --> 09:53.600
Is it about Chen Renran?

112
09:56.000 --> 09:56.460
Tangy,

113
09:56.460 --> 09:58.600
I know you mean well,

114
09:58.790 --> 09:59.700
but Chen Renran and I

115
09:59.700 --> 10:01.010
will never be a thing.

116
10:01.250 --> 10:02.000
I ran into him today

117
10:02.000 --> 10:03.120
but didn't make it clear to him.

118
10:03.120 --> 10:04.750
Could you talk to him for me?

119
10:05.220 --> 10:06.120
It's my fault.

120
10:06.130 --> 10:07.870
My good intentions were misguided.

121
10:07.870 --> 10:08.600
Tomorrow,

122
10:08.600 --> 10:09.790
Xia and I will look for him

123
10:09.790 --> 10:10.920
and clear things up.

124
10:12.620 --> 10:13.410
But Lili,

125
10:14.300 --> 10:15.470
tonight, did

126
10:15.720 --> 10:17.780
nothing really happen with Fu Shize?

127
10:25.390 --> 10:26.660
What? He...

128
10:28.880 --> 10:30.060
He held your hand?

129
10:32.000 --> 10:32.790
Tangy,

130
10:32.810 --> 10:34.950
do you think he likes me?

131
10:36.860 --> 10:38.290
Based on your description,

132
10:38.290 --> 10:39.550
what else could it be?

133
10:41.320 --> 10:42.850
But he had a lot to drink.

134
10:44.810 --> 10:45.700
But

135
10:45.820 --> 10:47.700
when I observed him just now,

136
10:47.750 --> 10:49.650
he seemed pretty sober.

137
10:50.010 --> 10:52.050
So I don't know if he...

138
10:52.410 --> 10:53.200
For such a thing,

139
10:53.200 --> 10:54.220
you should clarify it with him

140
10:54.220 --> 10:55.460
when he's sober.

141
10:55.550 --> 10:56.890
But aren't you angry?

142
10:59.150 --> 11:01.210
T-That was just a misunderstanding.

143
11:01.750 --> 11:03.150
What I mean is you've been

144
11:03.220 --> 11:04.320
chasing him for so long,

145
11:04.320 --> 11:05.980
and he'd never reciprocated.

146
11:08.720 --> 11:10.550
Actually, I thought I'd have to

147
11:10.550 --> 11:12.120
chase him for another year or so.

148
11:12.120 --> 11:13.120
So right now,

149
11:13.120 --> 11:14.500
I feel like I'm dreaming.

150
11:14.500 --> 11:15.100
It's like I've

151
11:15.100 --> 11:16.150
achieved a little milestone.

152
11:16.150 --> 11:17.750
I'm a-actually quite happy.

153
11:19.750 --> 11:21.390
But now I'm afraid that

154
11:21.390 --> 11:23.290
tomorrow morning, he'll say,

155
11:23.360 --> 11:24.010
"Sorry.

156
11:24.010 --> 11:25.500
I was drunk last night."

157
11:26.760 --> 11:28.490
I should've recorded it!

158
11:28.650 --> 11:29.620
Yes, yes,

159
11:29.650 --> 11:30.600
you should've recorded it,

160
11:30.600 --> 11:32.400
and then play it at your wedding.

161
11:32.550 --> 11:34.000
Wed... Wedding?

162
11:36.410 --> 11:36.890
Tangy!

163
11:36.890 --> 11:38.200
Get a grip!

164
11:51.000 --> 11:51.860
Last night...

165
11:51.890 --> 11:52.700
Sorry.

166
11:56.250 --> 11:57.540
I was drunk last night.

167
13:19.630 --> 13:20.360
Last night...

168
13:20.360 --> 13:22.120
I know you were drunk last night...

169
13:22.120 --> 13:22.650
Lili.

170
13:33.100 --> 13:35.750
Call me... that again.

171
13:38.840 --> 13:40.650
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

172
13:39.050 --> 13:40.220
Call me that again.

173
13:40.680 --> 13:43.680
♪ Telling me to bravely follow my heart ♪

174
13:43.720 --> 13:45.580
Yun Lili.

175
13:45.550 --> 13:48.000
♪ Until you came along ♪

176
13:46.670 --> 13:48.150
Phew, it's not a dream.

177
13:48.030 --> 13:51.660
♪ And made my heart skip a beat ♪

178
13:50.750 --> 13:53.120
Are you awake?

179
13:53.640 --> 13:55.950
♪ Not much has to be said ♪

180
13:55.370 --> 13:55.870
Mm.

181
13:55.970 --> 13:59.300
♪ One look is all it takes ♪

182
13:57.390 --> 13:58.220
I'm sober too.

183
14:01.030 --> 14:03.030
♪ That distant silhouette ♪

184
14:03.050 --> 14:07.310
♪ Became crystal clear in this moment ♪

185
14:03.890 --> 14:04.750
Come and sit.

186
14:08.720 --> 14:12.200
♪ I know those fears ♪

187
14:12.220 --> 14:15.140
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

188
14:16.000 --> 14:16.890
Stay with me for a bit.

189
14:16.680 --> 14:19.520
♪ But I still believe ♪

190
14:19.540 --> 14:22.230
♪ That we'll meet someday ♪

191
14:23.470 --> 14:24.670
I... I'll go get a glass of water.

192
14:24.620 --> 14:26.210
♪ It's you ♪

193
14:26.230 --> 14:28.540
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

194
14:27.910 --> 14:28.580
I'll go.

195
14:28.560 --> 14:30.080
♪ Just you ♪

196
14:30.110 --> 14:32.470
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

197
14:32.500 --> 14:33.880
♪ This moon tonight ♪

198
14:33.900 --> 14:36.140
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

199
14:36.160 --> 14:39.470
♪ And keeps me company through the endless night ♪

200
14:39.910 --> 14:41.580
♪ It's you ♪

201
14:41.610 --> 14:43.770
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

202
14:43.810 --> 14:44.830
♪ Just you ♪

203
14:45.110 --> 14:47.450
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

204
14:47.580 --> 14:49.000
♪ By your side ♪

205
14:49.020 --> 14:50.000
♪ Even the most ♪

206
14:50.030 --> 14:52.380
♪ Ordinary seasons feel warm again ♪

207
14:53.430 --> 14:56.390
♪ It's you ♪

208
15:06.820 --> 15:07.500
Thanks.

209
15:07.090 --> 15:09.040
♪ If sometimes ♪

210
15:09.060 --> 15:12.870
♪ You feel discouraged ♪

211
15:13.980 --> 15:15.980
♪ I'll be behind you ♪

212
15:16.100 --> 15:19.370
♪ And keep all the rainstorms from you ♪

213
15:21.670 --> 15:23.860
♪ I don't need anyone to prove ♪

214
15:23.890 --> 15:27.690
♪ Whether I win in this adventure ♪

215
15:25.150 --> 15:27.600
I already drank from... this cup.

216
15:29.250 --> 15:31.170
♪ Let me draw near again ♪

217
15:31.190 --> 15:34.910
♪ Every little bit of your heart ♪

218
15:33.200 --> 15:33.600
Mm.

219
15:36.820 --> 15:40.300
♪ I know those fears ♪

220
15:40.370 --> 15:44.630
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

221
15:44.840 --> 15:47.680
♪ But I still believe ♪

222
15:47.720 --> 15:50.410
♪ That we'll meet someday ♪

223
15:52.780 --> 15:54.370
♪ It's you ♪

224
15:54.390 --> 15:56.690
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

225
15:56.720 --> 15:58.240
♪ Just you ♪

226
15:58.270 --> 16:00.630
♪ Feel so right to my heart ♪

227
16:00.660 --> 16:02.040
♪ This moon tonight ♪

228
16:02.060 --> 16:04.300
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

229
16:04.320 --> 16:07.620
♪ And keeps me company through the endless night ♪

230
16:08.070 --> 16:09.740
♪ It's you ♪

231
16:09.770 --> 16:11.930
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

232
16:11.970 --> 16:13.240
♪ Just you ♪

233
16:13.270 --> 16:15.610
♪ Can fill the emptiness in my heart ♪

234
16:15.740 --> 16:17.160
♪ By your side ♪

235
16:17.180 --> 16:18.160
♪ Even the most ♪

236
16:18.190 --> 16:20.540
♪ Ordinary seasons feel warm again ♪

237
16:21.590 --> 16:24.640
♪ It's you ♪

238
16:57.100 --> 16:57.890
Congsheng?

239
16:58.430 --> 16:59.150
Why is it you?

240
16:59.150 --> 17:00.150
Where's Tang Lin?

241
17:00.310 --> 17:01.250
Why are you looking for her

242
17:01.250 --> 17:02.780
first thing in the morning?

243
17:03.120 --> 17:04.849
To have breakfast, of course.

244
17:05.280 --> 17:06.050
You go first.

245
17:06.079 --> 17:07.680
She still needs to get ready.

246
17:07.960 --> 17:08.810
It's fine.

247
17:09.310 --> 17:10.109
Tang Lin!

248
17:10.369 --> 17:11.390
Take your time! It's fine!

249
17:11.390 --> 17:12.390
I'll wait for you!

250
17:13.310 --> 17:14.920
Overly attentive.

251
17:14.920 --> 17:16.119
You're acting weird.

252
17:16.290 --> 17:17.490
How am I acting weird?

253
17:28.680 --> 17:30.080
L-Let's have breakfast.

254
17:31.810 --> 17:33.270
You didn't close the door.

255
17:35.220 --> 17:36.010
Wait for me!

256
17:43.750 --> 17:45.150
What do you want to drink?

257
17:46.050 --> 17:47.050
Anything's fine.

258
17:47.790 --> 17:48.590
Orange juice?

259
17:48.590 --> 17:49.420
Too sweet.

260
17:50.850 --> 17:51.660
Milk?

261
17:52.000 --> 17:53.050
Not whole milk.

262
17:53.560 --> 17:54.470
Not whole milk.

263
17:54.500 --> 17:55.360
This one, then.

264
18:05.220 --> 18:06.420
I want egg fried rice.

265
18:06.790 --> 18:07.510
Since when did you

266
18:07.510 --> 18:08.900
start eating egg fried rice?

267
18:08.900 --> 18:09.700
Can't I?

268
18:09.960 --> 18:10.610
You can, you can.

269
18:10.610 --> 18:11.810
I-I'll get it for you.

270
18:12.420 --> 18:13.220
No scallions.

271
18:13.500 --> 18:14.050
Thanks.

272
18:15.010 --> 18:16.770
Are you allergic to eggs?

273
18:18.550 --> 18:19.880
You don't know me at all!

274
18:20.090 --> 18:21.010
You don't even know if

275
18:21.010 --> 18:22.540
I'm allergic to eggs or not?

276
18:24.040 --> 18:25.150
I should know...

277
18:25.850 --> 18:27.260
I'll get it for you.

278
18:28.660 --> 18:29.460
Xia.

279
18:31.230 --> 18:32.150
What's that?

280
18:32.150 --> 18:32.920
Is it good?

281
18:33.560 --> 18:35.360
The strawberries are a bit sour.

282
18:41.510 --> 18:42.570
This one's not bad.

283
18:43.350 --> 18:45.010
Egg fried rice, no scallions.

284
18:47.510 --> 18:48.520
Fu Zhengchu,

285
18:48.960 --> 18:50.660
you've been acting weird lately.

286
18:50.660 --> 18:51.350
Me?

287
18:51.590 --> 18:52.920
No, I'm very normal.

288
18:55.050 --> 18:56.910
You used to always provoke Tangy.

289
18:57.000 --> 18:57.810
Why are you

290
18:57.810 --> 18:59.810
acting like a good little puppy now?

291
19:00.000 --> 19:00.750
Congsheng,

292
19:00.750 --> 19:01.900
you don't understand.

293
19:01.900 --> 19:02.810
This is called

294
19:03.550 --> 19:04.610
being a gentleman.

295
19:07.350 --> 19:08.880
Why don't you act like a gentleman

296
19:08.880 --> 19:09.790
to your sister?

297
19:14.490 --> 19:15.460
My darling sister,

298
19:15.460 --> 19:17.250
what do you want to eat?

299
19:18.140 --> 19:19.550
Corn, watermelon, cantaloupe,

300
19:19.550 --> 19:22.280
pineapple, strawberries, and cherry tomatoes.

301
19:22.850 --> 19:24.180
Can you finish all that?

302
19:24.810 --> 19:25.810
And a plate of

303
19:25.840 --> 19:27.670
egg fried rice, no scallions.

304
19:29.510 --> 19:32.110
You're not allergic to eggs, are you?

305
19:32.700 --> 19:34.320
You don't even know if I'm allergic or not?

306
19:34.320 --> 19:35.690
You don't know me at all.

307
19:41.460 --> 19:42.420
Coming right up,

308
19:42.460 --> 19:43.320
my dear sister.

309
19:50.420 --> 19:51.880
Is it too red?

310
20:14.400 --> 20:15.010
Hello?

311
20:15.850 --> 20:16.530
Hello, Li.

312
20:16.540 --> 20:17.700
How are you spending New Year's Eve?

313
20:17.700 --> 20:18.500
I don't know.

314
20:20.010 --> 20:22.700
Can I go to Nanwu for New Year's?

315
20:23.200 --> 20:24.330
The 30th is a Sunday.

316
20:24.340 --> 20:25.610
I can take a later flight.

317
20:25.610 --> 20:26.940
What are you coming for?

318
20:27.160 --> 20:28.590
To spend the New Year with you.

319
20:28.590 --> 20:30.160
Your ID card's with you.

320
20:30.160 --> 20:32.010
I can't tie you down either.

321
20:32.010 --> 20:33.160
Go wherever you want.

322
20:33.160 --> 20:35.290
I'll pretend I didn't hear this, okay?

323
20:35.400 --> 20:37.000
Flights are so expensive.

324
20:37.110 --> 20:38.010
Please.

325
20:38.180 --> 20:38.830
I'm broke.

326
20:39.530 --> 20:39.900
Right,

327
20:39.900 --> 20:41.290
in your last finals,

328
20:41.290 --> 20:42.330
how did you rank?

329
20:42.700 --> 20:43.830
Eighth in the grade.

330
20:46.240 --> 20:46.750
Fine.

331
20:46.750 --> 20:47.740
Maintain this standard

332
20:47.740 --> 20:49.000
in the upcoming finals,

333
20:49.000 --> 20:50.500
and I'll begrudgingly

334
20:50.500 --> 20:51.960
cover your flight ticket.

335
20:52.410 --> 20:53.120
I promise!

336
20:53.140 --> 20:54.670
I promise I'll maintain it.

337
20:55.090 --> 20:56.700
Can you give me

338
20:57.100 --> 20:58.900
that flight money in advance?

339
20:59.050 --> 20:59.850
No.

340
20:59.950 --> 21:01.210
Just focus on your exams,

341
21:01.210 --> 21:01.770
okay?

342
21:01.770 --> 21:02.510
Keep it up.

343
21:03.110 --> 21:04.330
Bye, I'm busy.

344
21:10.680 --> 21:12.330
Who were you on the phone with?

